%% Slices decide implementation order and nothing else:
%%   s1 the read-only home, shaped by permissions   s2 act from it
%%   s3 manager depth: activity, charges today, the Organization's Properties
%% A flowchart rather than usecase-beta: see .claude/skills/feature-design/SKILL.md step b.
%% Refusals and empty answers are rows in edge-cases.csv, not use cases.
%% The visual reference is docs/design/mockups/today.html.
flowchart TD

  SM["Staff Member<br/>at a Property they reach, with Today"]
  FD["focus: front desk<br/>holds front_desk.check_in or check_out"]
  HK["focus: housekeeping<br/>holds housekeeping.update_status, no front desk"]
  FN["focus: finance<br/>holds finance.*, no front desk"]
  MG["focus: manager<br/>holds staff.administer or audit.read"]
  SM --> FD & HK & FN & MG

  subgraph S1["slice 1 &mdash; the read-only home"]
    DAY(["See the Property's working day<br/>business date, local clock, freshness"])
    ATT(["See what needs attention<br/>each item opens the record that resolves it"])
    TILES(["Read four figures for my focus<br/>each opens the filtered list"])
    MOVE(["See today's movements<br/>arrivals and departures, readiness, balance"])
    CLEAN(["See which rooms to clean first<br/>arrival today, then leaving today"])
    OWED(["See who leaves with a balance<br/>and the largest open balances"])
    ROOMS(["See room readiness by floor"])
  end

  subgraph S2["slice 2 &mdash; act from it"]
    CHECKIN(["Check a Guest in from a row<br/>the Arrivals dialog, unchanged"])
    CHECKOUT(["Check a Guest out from a row<br/>the Departures dialog, unchanged"])
    MARK(["Mark a room clean or inspected<br/>the board's command, unchanged"])
  end

  subgraph S3["slice 3 &mdash; manager depth"]
    FEED(["See recent activity<br/>the audit log's newest records"])
    CHARGES(["See charges posted today"])
    ORG(["See every Property I reach<br/>and switch to one"])
    FORECAST(["See booked occupancy for 14 days"])
  end

  FD --> DAY & ATT & TILES & MOVE & ROOMS
  HK --> DAY & ATT & TILES & CLEAN & ROOMS
  FN --> DAY & ATT & TILES & OWED
  MG --> DAY & ATT & TILES & MOVE & ROOMS
  MOVE -. extend .-> CHECKIN & CHECKOUT
  CLEAN -. extend .-> MARK
  MG --> FEED & CHARGES & ORG & FORECAST

  %% Deferred, each waiting on its own module: Guest requests, maintenance
  %% blockers (#61), shift handover and day close (RANZ-26), inventory,
  %% approvals, integrations, rates and revenue, a customisable layout, and a
  %% same-day late check-out, which needs a check-out time no Property has yet.
